Upstream colour changes: briantoll, PR157 head
9d3aeb24cb864d5f99a7172e9004884bf3c1a9a0.
Includes the validate-before-commit follow-up from
patches/dcp-colorimetry-valid-replacement.patch.

Original Apple DCP files retain GPL-2.0-only OR MIT and their copyright
attribution. Context adapted for .20's split H17P/template layout. This
patch changes the older 12.3/13.5/14.7 template; it does not modify the
separate .20 H17P template. The upstream defaults are retained.

Build/research candidate only, not an installer or native colour/HDR
qualification. Keep the separately tested J613 internal-backlight patch
in both reference and candidate. No module has been installed or loaded.

